The original PDF files retain authorship, title, publication year and publisher
notices. Per-work titles, attribution, publisher URLs and content hashes are
recorded in bulk_catalog.json and bulk_registry.json. This project extracts
plain text and adds physical-page markers for retrieval; PDF text extraction
is a modification and is not a substitute for figures or precise table layout.
No author or publisher endorsement of this project is implied.
